CCTPBridgeModule_Constructor
├── when tokenMessenger is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_ZeroTokenMessenger
├── when usdc is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_ZeroUSDC
└── when all parameters are valid
    ├── it should store tokenMessenger as immutable
    └── it should store usdc as immutable
